@step List the declared descendientes with their positions.
@static aeat config profile descendiente list
@blocked unconverted Runs clean in the sandbox probe; nothing blocks it, so it awaits conversion.
@step Add one descendiente as comma-separated KEY=VALUE pairs.
@static aeat config profile descendiente add --descendiente NACIMIENTO=2018-04-01,DISCAPACIDAD=0,CONVIVENCIA=true
@blocked unconverted Runs clean in the sandbox probe; nothing blocks it, so it awaits conversion.
@step Remove the descendiente at position 0.
@static aeat config profile descendiente remove 0
@blocked unconverted Runs clean in the sandbox probe; nothing blocks it, so it awaits conversion.
